  <div class="page">
    <h1 class="pdx-txt-title">Edit Drawer</h1>
    <p class="pdx-txt-body pdx-ink-muted intro">
      <code>&lt;pdx-edit-drawer&gt;</code> — a drawer hosting a schema-driven form for creating or
      editing one entity. Composes <code>pdx-drawer</code> + <code>pdx-form-template</code>. On Save
      it validates and emits <code>pdx-save</code> with the values; <code>value=null</code> → create.
    </p>

    <pdx-demo-comp-edit-drawer-create-edit class="demo-section"></pdx-demo-comp-edit-drawer-create-edit>

    <section>
