    <h1 class="pdx-txt-title">Fieldset</h1>
    <p class="pdx-txt-body pdx-ink-muted intro">
      <code>&lt;pdx-fieldset&gt;</code> — semantic form group with native <code>&lt;fieldset&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;legend&gt;</code>.
      Collapsible, disabled propagation, error state.
