      <code>:navbarCollapsed</code>; it says what it controls and whether the navigation is expanded.
    </p>
    <div class="demo-shell">
      <pdx-app-layout headerheight="44px" navbarwidth="160px" asidewidth="120px" footerheight="36px" :navbar-collapsed=\${() => !ctx.navOpen()}>
        <div data-region="header" class="shell-header">
          <button type="button" class="shell-hamburger" aria-label="Toggle navigation" aria-controls="demo-nav-1"
                  :aria-expanded=\${() => ctx.navOpen() ? 'true' : 'false'} @click=\${safeHandler(() => ctx.navOpen.set(!ctx.navOpen()), ctx.el?.tagName?.toLowerCase(), 'click')}><pdx-icon name="menu" size="14"></pdx-icon></button>
