      <summary>Source</summary>
      <pre class="pdx-txt-mono"><code>&lt;pdx-context-menu :items="menuItems" @pdx-select="onSelect"&gt;
  &lt;!-- focusable, so Shift+F10 and the menu key can reach it --&gt;
