    <h2 class="pdx-txt-heading section-heading">A nested object</h2>
    <p class="pdx-txt-small pdx-ink-muted">
      The form validates <code>onChange</code>: clear the customer's email, or type a wrong one, and the error
      appears under the field as you type — on the nested path <code>customer.email</code>.
    </p>
    <div class="demo-split">
      <pdx-form :form=\${() => ctx.orderForm} @pdx-submit=\${safeHandler(ctx.submitOrder, ctx.el?.tagName?.toLowerCase(), 'pdx-submit')}>
