    <p class="pdx-txt-small pdx-ink-muted">
      <code>step-mode="caret"</code>: Arrow Up/Down (and the wheel) change the digit before the cursor —
      <code>12|3</code> ↑ is 133, <code>1.2|5</code> ↑ is 1.35 — and the cursor stays on that digit, also when the
